{"meta":{"format_version":"5.0","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"hare","model_identifier":"hare","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","multi_file_ruleset":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# hare\n\nHare (B9), 45 cm long (16 u), brown-grey with long black-tipped ears.\n\nSmall game: compact body with big haunches, long hind feet, short forelegs, long ears on the head bone, white scut. Quadruped rig (root > body > neck > head, tail_1, four legs).\n\n- Cubes: 20 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -3.2..3.2, y -0.0..15.0, z -11.0..8.5 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 5 x 15 x 18 (w x h x d) centred on x = 0, z = -1, from y = 0 (ears included)\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 3 | loop | crouched, ears and head turning (loop) |\n| `walk` | 0.6 | loop | slow shuffle-hop while feeding |\n| `hop` | 0.45 | loop | relaxed hopping |\n| `run` | 0.28 | loop | flat-out bounding flight (runs away when attacked) |\n| `sit_up` | 2.4 | once | rears up on the haunches to look around (up at 0.4 s, looks 1.1 / 1.7 s, down at 2.4 s) |\n| `graze` | 2.4 | loop | nibbling the grass (loop) |\n| `injured` | 0.6 | once | flinch |\n| `death` | 1 | hold | falls onto its side, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n| `mate` | 2.0 | loop | Patch 5: a gentle nuzzle toward the partner on the model's left (head and neck turn, body sway, tail wag; birds fluff their wings, the hare hops), played by two animals side by side while the game draws hearts over them. |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 17.8 u/s (0.5 m/s), cycle 0.6 s, 11 u per cycle\n- `hop`: 42.7 u/s (1.2 m/s), cycle 0.45 s, 19 u per cycle\n- `run`: 248.9 u/s (7.0 m/s), cycle 0.28 s, 70 u per cycle\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n\n## Variant textures (same UV layout)\n\n- `hare_young.png`: leveret texture (use at half scale): softer, lighter fur\n\n## Notes\n\n- Gives meat and hide when killed."},"resolution":{"width":64,"height":64},"elements":[{"name":"body","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-2.5,3.5,-4.5],"to":[2.5,8.5,2],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[0,6,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[14,7,19,12],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0,7,6.5,12],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[19,7,24,12],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[7,7,13.5,12],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[24,0,29,6.5],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[29,0,34,6.5],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"8defed44-dda3-56dc-b22e-7cc89670c3ff"},{"name":"haunch","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-3,3,1],"to":[3,9.5,7],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[0,6,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0,0,6,6.5],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[6,0,12,6.5],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[12,0,18,6.5],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[18,0,24,6.5],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[34,0,40,6],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[40,0,46,6],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"e7a80eb8-3c3e-57c2-b038-4c72f91e348c"},{"name":"chest","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-2,3,-6],"to":[2,7.5,-4],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[0,6,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[24,7,28,11.5],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[60,7,62,11.5],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[28,7,32,11.5],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[62,7,64,11.5],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[28,17,32,19],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[32,17,36,19],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"31732d74-2999-5a2b-be0f-9f2681cde8cd"},{"name":"head","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-2,6.5,-10],"to":[2,10,-6],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[0,8,-6.5],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[8,12,12,15.5],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[12,12,16,15.5],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[1